      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1961 West Haven became Connecticut’s youngest city, a milestone celebrated by the Library of Congress as a “Local Legacy.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
