      "source": "https://www.britannica.com/place/West-Haven",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A 1938 mural in the main post office commemorates the historic horse‑bridge crossing of the West River into what was once called West Farms.",
